@@ -0,0 +1,157 @@
+# Activities
+
+Activities are the events that happen in an account, such as cards being added, assigned, moved, or commented on. They're the same events shown in the "Latest Activity" timeline.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activity on the boards you have access to, sorted by most recent first. Results can be filtered using query parameters.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the ID(s) of the users who performed the activity |
+
+Repeated values of the same parameter are ORed together. Different filters combine with AND.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vbmjmr4cxokzrhbwr2t5n",
+    "action": "card_triaged",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:40:12.031Z",
+    "description": "David Heinemeier Hansson moved &quot;First!&quot; to \"In Progress\"",
+    "particulars": {
+      "column": "In Progress"
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 4,
+      "title": "First!",
+      "status": "published",
+      "description": "Hello, World!",
+      "description_html": "<div class=\"action-text-content\"><p>Hello, World!</p></div>",
+      "image_url": null,
+      "has_attachments": false,
+      "tags": ["programming"],
+      "closed": false,
+      "postponed": false,
+      "golden": false,
+      "last_active_at": "2025-12-05T19:40:12.031Z",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.540Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+      "board": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+        "name": "Fizzy",
+        "all_access": true,
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+        "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+        "creator": {
+          "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+          "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+          "role": "owner",
+          "active": true,
+          "email_address": "david@example.com",
+          "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+          "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+        }
+      },
+      "column": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcn",
+        "name": "In Progress",
+        "color": {
+          "name": "Lime",
+          "value": "var(--color-card-4)"
+        },
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z"
+      },
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      },
+      "assignees": [],
+      "has_more_assignees": false,
+      "comments_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/comments",
+      "reactions_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/reactions"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      }
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+Each activity contains:
+
+| Field | Description |
+|-------|-------------|
+| `action` | What happened. See the list of actions below |
+| `description` | A plain-text sentence describing the activity, worded for the current user. HTML special characters are escaped |
+| `particulars` | Details specific to the action. See below |
+| `url` | Where to see the activity in Fizzy. Card activity opens the card; comment activity opens the card the comment was posted on and jumps to the comment, e.g. `http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4#comment_03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz` |
+| `eventable_type` | The type of record the activity is about: `Card` or `Comment` |
+| `eventable` | The [card](cards.md) or [comment](comments.md) the activity is about |
+| `board` | The [board](boards.md) where the activity happened |
+| `creator` | The [user](users.md) who performed the activity |
+
+__Actions:__
+
+| Action | Eventable | Description |
+|--------|-----------|-------------|
+| `card_published` | `Card` | A card was added |
+| `card_assigned` | `Card` | Someone was assigned to a card |
+| `card_unassigned` | `Card` | Someone was unassigned from a card |
+| `card_title_changed` | `Card` | A card was renamed |
+| `card_board_changed` | `Card` | A card was moved to another board |
+| `card_triaged` | `Card` | A card was moved into a column |
+| `card_sent_back_to_triage` | `Card` | A card was moved back to "Maybe?" |
+| `card_postponed` | `Card` | A card was moved to "Not Now" |
+| `card_auto_postponed` | `Card` | A card was moved to "Not Now" due to inactivity |
+| `card_closed` | `Card` | A card was moved to "Done" |
+| `card_reopened` | `Card` | A card was reopened |
+| `comment_created` | `Comment` | A comment was added to a card |
+
+__Particulars:__
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids`: the IDs of the users who were assigned or unassigned |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board` and `new_board`: the names of the boards the card was moved from and to |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title` and `new_title`: the card title before and after the change |
+| `card_triaged` | `column`: the name of the column the card was moved into |
+
+Other actions return an empty `particulars` object. Board, title, and column values that weren't recorded are returned as empty strings.
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4fb8648
